Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Replace face enroll particle animation with progress ring

Draw enrollment progress as a ring around the preview cutout instead
of the legacy particle animation, move the help text above the
preview, keep each help message visible long enough to be read and
drop the "Steps: Remaining:" debug text.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ic3166406c665523bb5846db85f60ab2efc83427a
